ponytail — https://github.com/DietrichGebert/ponytail

The `ponytail` role name and the behavioural rules of its presets
(`integrations/claude/agents/aorch-ponytail.md` and
`integrations/codex/agents/aorch-ponytail.toml`) are adapted from ponytail.
The wording is our own; the approach — refusing to write code before asking
whether it needs to exist, and climbing a fixed ladder of questions first — is
theirs.

